### Asteroid Risk Dashboard — REST Client requests
### Install: VS Code extension "REST Client" by Huachao Mao
### Usage: click "Send Request" above each block

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

# ── Health ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health check — should return {status: ok}
GET {{baseUrl}}/

# ── Core endpoints ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Threat feed — asteroids sorted by risk_score DESC (next 30 days)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed

### Dashboard stats — totals, closest this week, avg risk
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats

### Historical — monthly flyby counts + avg risk (last 12 months)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/historical

# ── Asteroid detail ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Asteroid detail — replace ID with a real neo_reference_id from /api/feed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/asteroids/54376661

### 404 test — unknown ID should return 404 with error message
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/asteroids/FAKE_ID_DOES_NOT_EXIST

# ── Cesium trajectory ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Trajectory — 100 sampled orbital positions for CesiumJS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/asteroids/54376661/trajectory

# ── Swagger UI ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Open in browser: http://localhost:8000/docs
### Open in browser: http://localhost:8000/redoc
